### Example 1: Minimal Style for Fashion Store

```json
{
  "type": "smart-product-recommendations",
  "settings": {
    "heading": "Complete Your Look",
    "products_to_show": 6,
    "card_style": "minimal",
    "columns_desktop": 6,
    "show_vendor": true
  }
}
```

### Example 2: Detailed Cards for Electronics

```json
{
  "type": "smart-product-recommendations",
  "settings": {
    "heading": "Customers Also Bought",
    "products_to_show": 4,
    "card_style": "detailed",
    "show_rating": true,
    "enable_same_collection": true
  }
